---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const title = 'Privacy & Cookie Policy';
const description =
  'How VAX collects, uses and protects personal data, and how cookies and consent are handled on this website, in line with the EU General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR).';
---

<Base title={title} description={description}>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span class="breadcrumb__sep">/</span>
        <span>Privacy &amp; Cookie Policy</span>
      </nav>
      <h1>Privacy &amp; Cookie Policy</h1>
      <p class="page-hero__sub">
        This policy explains what data we collect through this website, why, and
        the choices you have. It follows the principles of the EU General Data
        Protection Regulation (GDPR).
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h2>1. Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        VAX is a manufacturer of industrial vacuum heat treatment furnaces. For
        questions about this policy or your personal data, contact us at
        <a href="mailto:vax@levuzo.com">vax@levuzo.com</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Data we collect through this website</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Inquiry form.</strong> When you submit the contact form, the
          details you enter (name, company, email, phone, product of interest,
          requirements) are transmitted through the FormSubmit service and
          forwarded to our sales mailbox, together with the technical details
          of your submission — date and time, the page you submitted from, your
          IP address and your browser/user-agent string. We use this data only
          to answer your inquiry and prepare a quotation. Legal basis:
          pre-contractual steps and your consent at submission.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Consent preference.</strong> Your cookie choice is stored in
          your browser's local storage under the key
          <code>vax-cookie-consent</code>. This is strictly necessary to record
          and honour your consent, and it never leaves your device.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Analytics (only with your consent).</strong> If you accept
          in the cookie banner, we load Google Analytics 4 to measure how this
          website is used — pages visited, session duration, general region and
          device type. It sets the cookies listed in section 3. If you decline,
          no analytics cookies are set at all. Legal basis: your consent.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. Cookies and similar technologies</h2>
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Name</th>
            <th>Type</th>
            <th>Purpose</th>
            <th>Consent required</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td><code>vax-cookie-consent</code> (local storage)</td>
            <td>Strictly necessary</td>
            <td>Remembers your cookie consent decision</td>
            <td>No</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><code>_ga</code> (cookie)</td>
            <td>Analytics</td>
            <td>Distinguishes unique visitors (Google Analytics 4)</td>
            <td>Yes</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td><code>_ga_&lt;container-id&gt;</code> (cookie)</td>
            <td>Analytics</td>
            <td>Maintains session state (Google Analytics 4)</td>
            <td>Yes</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <p>
        Analytics cookies are optional and stay disabled until you accept in
        the cookie banner. If we add further features that require storage —
        for example embedded videos — they will follow the same rule.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Third parties</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>FormSubmit (formsubmit.co)</strong> processes the inquiry form
          and forwards it to our email address. Its handling of the one-time
          submission is governed by the FormSubmit privacy policy.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>ipify (api.ipify.org)</strong> is queried once when you submit
          the contact form, so the inquiry email records the IP address it was
          sent from. Only the IP address is exchanged.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Google Fonts</strong> serves the web fonts used for typography.
          Requests to Google's servers may expose your IP address to Google.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Google Analytics</strong> (loaded only after you accept in
          the cookie banner) measures website usage. Its handling of data is
          governed by the Google Privacy Policy.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Cloudflare</strong> delivers this website and may process
          standard technical logs for security and availability.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>5. Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        Under the GDPR you have the right to access, rectify, erase, restrict
        and port your personal data, and to object to its processing. You may
        withdraw your cookie consent at any time via
        <strong>Cookie Settings</strong> in the page footer. To exercise any
        data right, email
        <a href="mailto:vax@levuzo.com">vax@levuzo.com</a> — we respond
        within 30 days.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Retention</h2>
      <p>
        Inquiry emails are kept only as long as needed to handle your request
        and any follow-up business, then deleted or anonymised. Consent
        preferences stay in your browser until you clear them.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>
        If we change how we collect or use data, we will update this page and
        adjust the version shown in the site footer.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
